    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρραίνω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέρραγκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					7.17
				</span></i>
			:—<i>sprinkle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					56
				</span></i>
			; <i>shed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					10a
				</span></i>
			; <i>besprinkle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i> l. c.; <i>purify by lustration,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).593
				</span></i>
			A<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>(Ceos, 
				Pass.
			):—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρῷ ἡ γῆ διέρρανται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					7.27
				</span></i>
			:—also intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Ost.</u>
				9b
			</span></i>. </div>
